<title>USA: Foamex Q3 oper shr profit rises. [CORRECTED 23:43 GMT]</title>
<headline>Foamex Q3 oper shr profit rises. [CORRECTED 23:43 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LINWOOD, Pa. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr primary	  $0.29		    $0.04</p>
<p> Oper net		    7,356			977</p>
<p> Sales		     236,766		  217,036</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	    n/a			n/a</p>
<p>			Nine months</p>
<p> Oper shr primary	  $0.77		    $0.24</p>
<p> Oper net		   19,804		    6,375</p>
<p> Sales		     696,344		  651,928</p>
<p>(corrects the 1996 Nine months sales figure from 694,344)</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	    n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data 000s except per share)</p>
<p>NOTES: Operating results exclude loss for discontinued operations of about $73.6 million related primarily to the sale of JPS Automotive LP. 1996 Q3 net was a loss of $2.61 per share including loss from discontinued operations. Year-ago Q3 net was a loss of $0.02 including loss from discontinued operations.</p>
